Z||000012||Fiero5||08-27-2001||05:07 PM||||I have decided since I can only drive one Fiero, that I will be taking Fiero1 to Spindles this year. Since it is Marian and I anniversary (actually it's the 3rd), and we originally took Fiero1 (my very first Fiero) to Spindles those few years ago making it the first Fiero ever at Spindles. <P>I am already working on a few special added touches for her for this "anniversary" of sorts. Unless I can get a driver for Fiero9 also, so I can "take" both.<P>See you all there.<P>Steve<P>------------------<BR>                                      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Glowing_Fiero9_sig.jpg">          <BR>http://www.kelleyfamilyfieros.homestead.com/index.html||||reg||12
