Z||000023||Fiero5||08-30-2001||08:35 PM||||Here is an e-mail I got not too long ago from Warren Meyer, Spindles club president. He was responding to an e-mail I sent asking about pre-registering for the show.<P>&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;<P>From: "Warren Meyer" &lt;wtm442@mediaone.net&gt;<BR>To: "Steve Kelley" &lt;stevekelley@nhvt.net&gt;<BR>Subject: Re: Spindles car show Sept. 2nd  <P>Steve,<BR>We assumed you were coming again, so we added a Fiero class this year ...<BR>and we even have trophies!  But the trophies you brought last year were really nice.<P>Our web site is <A HREF="http://members.tripod.com/spindlescarclub/" TARGET=_blank>http://members.tripod.com/spindlescarclub/</A> <BR>let me know if you have any trouble. I just went there with no problems before sending this e-mail.<P>I also attached the "electronic flyer".<BR>The cost to enter car is $12 this year at the gate.  Too late to pre-register. That includes driver and one passenger and kids under 12 are free. The old flyer on the web site says $10, but we changed that back in<BR>May to $12.  Everything getting more expensive.  Dynamite goodie bag this year - even includes a t-shirt!<P>See you Sunday - its supposed to be a great day.  Gates for participants opens at 7 AM.  But the best time to get to the fairgrounds is between 8 and 8:30.  After 9:00 the line gets really looooooooooong, and about noon we normally shut off registration because were full.  Expect over 600 cars this year.<P>Warren<P>&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;<P>------------------<BR>                                      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Glowing_Fiero9_sig.jpg">          <BR>http://www.kelleyfamilyfieros.homestead.com/index.html||||reg||12
Z||000024||88CoupeV6||08-31-2001||06:15 PM||||2 days to the show and free t-sirts in the goodie bags   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  ALL SHOW UP please   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><BR>Here is the link with a Map to get there <A HREF="http://members.tripod.com/spindlescarclub/flyer_show_2001.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://members.tripod.com/spindlescarclub/flyer_show_2001.htm</A> <P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://people.ne.mediaone.net/fiero64/Fiero642.jpg">    <BR><B>Also 88 Yellow GT</B>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A><p>[This message has been edited by 88CoupeV6 (edited 08-31-2001).]||||reg||7
Z||000025||Boomtastic||08-31-2001||06:22 PM||||Ahh well, there's always this year to win the raffle!<P>------------------<BR>Boomtastic<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mirror_md_clr.gif"> ||||reg||12
Z||000026||Fiero5||08-31-2001||07:16 PM||||It would be great to have a HUGE turnout of Fieros in every shape, syle, mod and everything in between. Bring it even if it is a daily driver, in process or barely passes inspection. Let's make it a Fiero get together.<BR>We can have a Fiero party with the focus being not only on the quantity of Fieros present, but the comraderie of having so many Fiero owners/friends coming together.<BR>It's getting late in the car show season now, so here is a chance for alot of us to be able to get together and have some fun before the summer is over.<P>We hope to you see you there.<P>Steve Kelley & Family<P>------------------<BR>                                      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Glowing_Fiero9_sig.jpg">          <BR>http://www.kelleyfamilyfieros.homestead.com/index.html||||reg||12
