Z||000034||Fiero5||09-01-2001||11:09 PM||||Wow, I'm pooped!<BR>Been working on Fiero1 for a good part of the day and into the evening.<BR>Installed new mint stock seats, added new wing graphic to spoiler, ran to the fabric store to get material for headliner, ran to auto supplier for headliner glue, did some engine detailing, took out headliner and redid it with new material and then reinstalled it, replaced passenger side mirror and painted side mirrors, painted side rails, painted engine vents, ran to the store for more supplies, added a few touches to the battery area, ran to my dads for parts, replaced one rear tail lens assembly, replaced passenger side dew wip and replaced rubber side rails under hood. That's just about everything I did that I can remember at this late hour.<P>Goodnight, and hopefully I will see a bunch of you tomm at Spindles.<P>Steve<P>------------------<BR>                                        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero1sunburst.jpg.jpg">            <BR>http://www.kelleyfamilyfieros.homestead.com/index.html||||reg||11
Z||000035||88CoupeV6||09-01-2001||11:55 PM||||Can't wait, Less than 24 hours away  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||7
Z||000036||Boomtastic||09-03-2001||09:29 AM||||What a turn out! Not quite as expected, but how can you sneeze at 13 Fieros? And they say "13" is an unlucky number - bah! Talk about a high visibility spot - right near the toilets! (lol) Here's a few shots from the day. (Sorry - all pictures of the women walking the fairgrounds have been kept offline. Contact me directly if you want those shots.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> )<P>Here's a panoramic view of all 13 Fieros:<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cars.jpg">  <P>Fieros:<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cars1.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cars2.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cars3.jpg">  <P>------------------<BR>Boomtastic<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mirror_md_clr.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by Boomtastic (edited 09-03-2001).]||||reg||4
Z||000037||Boomtastic||09-03-2001||09:29 AM||||I presented Ray Paulk (NEFA club President)with the "Compass Award" because he could not find the show.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/compass_award.jpg">  <P>------------------<BR>Boomtastic<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mirror_md_clr.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by Boomtastic (edited 09-03-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000038||Fiero5||09-03-2001||03:37 PM||||"Patrick's Dad from Weymouth MA said:<P>Just talked to a friend of mine who's in Spindles. Their show is September 2 at the Marshfield Fair Grounds. He was saying that last year, a small group of Fieros entered, and even provided their own trophies. Anyone here that I missed meeting?<BR>This year, "Fiero" is one of the 49 categories (Kit Cars, too!). Anyone going?"<P>Did you go? If so, which car was yours? I talked to some great people, but I don't think anyone ever said that there Pennocks ID was Patricks Dad. Just wonderin' if you were there.<P>It was a great day.<P>Steve Kelley<P>------------------<BR>                                        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero1sunburst.jpg.jpg">            <BR>http://www.kelleyfamilyfieros.homestead.com/index.html||||reg||7
